From 1112d482677b330a3596ce756fe5e35a9c3f8f84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (BOR AI audit)" <claude@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 16:44:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(input): Enter = new line, arrow button is the only send;
 audit fixes

Input
- Enter/Shift+Enter insert a new line on every device; no other shortcut sends
- textarea auto-expands to min(220px,40dvh) then scrolls internally; send hit area 44px
Audit fixes (docs/AUDIT-BOR-AI.md)
- H1: platform capability notice on every agent (model no longer claims browsing/news)
- M1: opening a conversation returns the newest 500 messages + truncated flag
- M2: 150s client timeout with retry
Tests: composer, XSS/headers, capabilities, conversation limits, hang/timeout
